{"html":"<p>I was honored to be invited to speak at the popular-science forum of the Acoustical Society of China. Starting from my own experience running a Zhihu column and a WeChat account, I talked about how we communicate acoustics to the public.</p>\n<p>Fellow acousticians, comments and criticism are welcome, and submissions even more so. Let’s learn from each other and get better together!</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/916a5c88127de586b3076cff.webp\" alt=\"Title slide: Acoustics outreach in China: lessons from social media. Ziyu, on WeChat and Zhihu, Microflown Technologies. Background: a sound intensity vector field\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/435f10d2fc41e031fa63cbb6.webp\" alt=\"Sound intensity field of a loudspeaker, labeled past (backward propagation), present (near-field effect) and future (forward propagation)\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/11938360b5aae317642da4bd.webp\" alt=\"Today’s outline: 1. Why outreach matters; 2. Ways to do outreach; 3. Personal experience; 4. The state of acoustics outreach and its challenges; 5. A few thoughts on the future\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/93541abbabd6fc09319a138a.webp\" alt=\"Section title: Why outreach matters\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/2ad9a0311fc14908c6b3aeca.webp\" alt=\"Why outreach matters, for companies (a pile of money), for individuals (a figure climbing stairs) and for the public (a speaker explaining to a group)\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/ecd028dbfb2077fd4097a750.webp\" alt=\"Section title: Ways to do outreach\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/0a7436c96cd326c25a5c511e.webp\" alt=\"Ways to do outreach, external: publishing online on WeChat, Zhihu, Weibo and websites, leading to meetups online and offline\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/b413fd580d483e25a8bc914a.webp\" alt=\"Ways to do outreach, internal: explaining acoustics to the boss and to colleagues in other departments\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/d59b10fccbbf79f4546d7ad2.webp\" alt=\"Section title: The state of play and the challenges\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/aa482d950d23a674c285f0d7.webp\" alt=\"State of play: a niche. Examples of acoustics outreach online: Brüel &amp; Kjær (product knowledge and applications), The Sound Blog (fun facts and acoustic phenomena), Acoustic Fields (acoustic design), Linkwitz Lab (sound recording and reproduction), ISVR animations (acoustics basics), Acoustics Today (broad popular science), Kai’s thoughts (acoustic simulation), Audio Tech (audio and signal processing)\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/f3cd7c52953ea6c485b96e8e.webp\" alt=\"State of play: a niche. A table of Chinese WeChat accounts on acoustics and their focus, from Ziyu Acoustics (history of acoustics, popular science, industrial applications, poetry) and automotive NVH accounts to company accounts such as BSWA and Brüel &amp; Kjær and the accounts of the Acoustical Society of China and the Institute of Acoustics\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/96349762d3b8d27aa7f5f2cd.webp\" alt=\"State of play: a niche; acoustics is highly interdisciplinary, so there are many angles to write from. Word cloud of fields around acoustics\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/631509fbab3b2ca5aacbe165.webp\" alt=\"The same points, illustrated by the poster topics of the International Congress on Acoustics 2019, from active acoustic systems to virtual acoustics\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/0793d6aa55c68d0a8cfe82aa.webp\" alt=\"State of play, continued: more and more people work in acoustics and take it seriously, with examples from psychoacoustics, NVH, acoustics plus AI (Noisy Guts) and electric vehicles\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/010db4276437da278e335987.webp\" alt=\"State of play, continued: few people work on outreach, and few people know about it\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/237d1d89facd48f9452af5ab.webp\" alt=\"Challenges: a narrow audience; a growing field but few practitioners; for companies, a few giants dominate, and limited knowledge keeps people from seeing other possibilities\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/d4ff73e2830f0f5e7d139d1f.webp\" alt=\"Section title: Personal experience\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/80aa1d74670ad73a429c53a7.webp\" alt=\"Personal experience: Zhihu statistics of 759,901 total reads, 3,842 upvotes and 13,173 followers, the Zhihu profile, WeChat audience statistics, and an article on 2D/3D Scan &amp; Paint imaging\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/76e1a1aacfab589415e915b0.webp\" alt=\"Personal experience: two popular Zhihu answers, “Are German streets really full of handsome men?” and “Are there unwritten rules in academia?”\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/f5f4986c341356efc69fb3e4.webp\" alt=\"Personal experience, the original motivation: “We are born to leave our mark on the universe”\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/f65292327e7d1d114a7f5dcf.webp\" alt=\"Personal experience, key factors: passion; a thorough understanding of the product or technology\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/cbe62ae9e55c87988005719d.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: plain language, illustrated by a puzzled Jack Ma meme and a still of Jack Ma and Elon Musk on stage at the World Artificial Intelligence Conference\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/ba26a5a439c69e6a910a6a9f.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: keep it informal, with few formulas and plenty of figures and examples. Excerpt from my article on particle velocity: sound is not just about sound pressure\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/5ff18ff9e9e1792a6c9eee82.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: engage the senses with video and audio. Excerpt from my article on how we perceive pitch, video from smartereveryday.com\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/f246d958e2af697e9160c67b.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: humor, illustrated with memes from my articles, including a crosstalk duo joking about particle velocity\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/3b9013f45718cc6bcce34810.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: strong logic\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/b612ec67db318bfe5087f979.webp\" alt=\"Key factors, continued: for corporate outreach, don’t focus only on the company itself, and don’t turn it into a hard sell\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/8eb5930bac9c9e9c2c2d3ad0.webp\" alt=\"Section title: Thoughts on the future\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/e629b96b8f97f3d2f46ed097.webp\" alt=\"Thoughts on the future: getting the WeChat account and Zhihu column seen by more people, with a long way still to go. My Zhihu profile compared with that of a much larger audio account run by a JBL Professional engineer\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/25aa48211811ec0b9f30af9f.webp\" alt=\"Thoughts on the future, continued: winning the support of leading figures to extend the reach of outreach articles, through interviews and Zhihu Live talks\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/0568c8eb75f7fd7e1951f001.webp\" alt=\"Thoughts on the future, continued: collaborating to run outreach together; calling on PhD students, since the introduction of a thesis can make a great popular-science piece\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/b0b9bf62ea2457e30ae934aa.webp\" alt=\"Thoughts on the future, continued: offline events, which need funding\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/c1cd1ec2b99071afe403d4d8.webp\" alt=\"Section title: Summary\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/6214debb0fa995517a201125.webp\" alt=\"Summary: strong motivation; keep writing; only a deep understanding lets you play freely with plain language, jokes and illustrations; collaborate to enrich content online and offline\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/95edd824e434036e30b86036.webp\" alt=\"Thank you! Visit us at booths 14–15. Ziyu, Microflown Technologies, with a QR code\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Microflown regularly offers internships and master’s thesis positions:</p>\n<p>1. Internship: ACTIVE AND REACTIVE INTENSITY FOR NVH PROBLEMS</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-active-and-reactive-sound-intensity-for-nvh-problems/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-active-and-reactive-sound-intensity-for-nvh-problems/</a></p>\n<p>2. Internship: ARRAY SIGNAL PROCESSING FOR ACOUSTIC VECTOR SENSORS</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-array-signal-processing-for-acoustic-vector-sensors/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-array-signal-processing-for-acoustic-vector-sensors/</a></p>\n<p>3. Internship: IMAGE PROCESSING FOR SENSOR TRACKING</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-image-processing-for-sensor-tracking/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-image-processing-for-sensor-tracking/</a></p>\n<p>4. Internship: EMBEDDED SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-embedded-software-development/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/internship-embedded-software-development/</a></p>\n<p>5. Master’s thesis: NETWORK SYSTEMS ADMINISTRATOR</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/network-systems-administrator/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/network-systems-administrator/</a></p>\n<p>6. Master’s thesis: SOFTWARE DEVELOPER FOR VELO PLATFORM</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microflown.com/careers/software-developer-for-velo-platform/\">https://www.microflown.com/careers/software-developer-for-velo-platform/</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Scan to follow Ziyu Acoustics on WeChat</p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/4d74e561eba20b7e0f060974.webp\" alt=\"QR code for the Ziyu Acoustics WeChat account, with “Search on WeChat: Ziyu Acoustics”\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/acoustics-media/ec9b6fd65d73e95d9c36c695.webp\" alt=\"Feel free to share. To republish, please contact the author.\"></p>"}